{"skill":{"slug":"zoho-crm","displayName":"Zoho CRM"},"version":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790941414912,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":63777,"sha256":"558dbabcefe68fcdedd3acfafd901d2e8151d4ab2fd9a1c0ba6942a126ff74af","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2221,"sha256":"4b7ed2891b19f4d4da558bbb6bc70252057dd6ea320d3cc20e15d8e361dd0c84","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790941876464,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"b62fa0893a1f63e5ba134d76b33d0a0f2257c6fc6cb3dc68a6dcdc93de73b44d","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/b62fa0893a1f63e5ba134d76b33d0a0f2257c6fc6cb3dc68a6dcdc93de73b44d","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790941622484},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1790941876464},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed Zoho CRM integration that uses Maton-managed authentication and includes clear approval and scoping rules for writes, automation, credentials, and persistent triggers.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access, OAuth, and a Maton account are proportionate for a CRM API integration; raw HTTP with MATON_API_KEY is documented only as a fallback when the CLI cannot be used, with credential-handling cautions.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation is disclosed through pinned Maton CLI package commands and optional pinned SDK packages; no bundled executable files or hidden install scripts were present.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill includes broad CRM mutation examples and shared Maton trigger catalogues for other event sources, but repeatedly limits them to user-named tasks, least-privilege scopes, read-first behavior, and explicit approval for writes, functions, destinations, and local exec.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"OAuth credentials, deployed functions, triggers, and destinations can persist, but the artifact discloses this, warns about ongoing forwarding and local exec risks, and requires user approval and cleanup.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The documented capabilities match the stated Zoho CRM purpose: read, create, update, delete, search CRM records, retrieve org/settings metadata, and optionally build user-approved Maton functions or triggers for automation.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you intend to let Maton access the selected Zoho CRM account. Prefer read-only OAuth scopes when possible, confirm every write or deletion, avoid raw API keys unless the CLI cannot be used, and treat hosted functions, triggers, destinations, and watch --exec as persistent automation that should be narrowly scoped and removed when no longer needed.","findings":"[SkillSpector] expected: SkillSpector reported no issues; artifact review was consistent with a coherent, disclosed integration rather than hidden or purpose-mismatched behavior.\n[AIG-SARIF] expected: The static scan produced no results. Manual inspection found sensitive capabilities such as CRM writes, credentials, functions, triggers, and destinations, but they are disclosed and bounded by approval and scoping instructions.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790941876464}}}}}